{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/AboutThisGame.png?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you'll experience a smaller slice of the final game, packed with a wide variety of unique climbing obstacles and challenges. Climb your way out of the massive dome that traps you, relying on precision and skill to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo drops you into one massive, fully playable level (The Dome), packed with some of the toughest challenges from the full game. Have fun\u2014and good luck making it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/GIF_Challenges-min.gif?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb, drive, dodge, roll, run, explore, swim, fly, grind... all to reach the top, combining climbing with unique minigames in every biome:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kart parkour levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backrooms and mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Golf Rollin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SkyBlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-Based Challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much, much, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/GIF_Gamemodes.gif?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different gameplay styles based on your chosen challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STREAMER TWITCH</strong>:\u00a0<u>Connect your game to your Twitch channel</u>! Your chat can interact and mess with you using commands, subs, and bits! In return, you\u2019ll unlock character upgrades, and either you or your chat will have to choose between different options. How about a double jump in exchange for 5 subs?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPEEDRUN</strong>:\u00a0Compete to reach the global top of the <u>Steam leaderboard</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Trial</strong>: Reach the next checkpoint before the timer hits 0 to reset it. There's no time for falling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: Do you like cozy games where you can relax by baking cakes? Well, in this game, you need to sit on the cake and... try to reach the top without losing control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/GIF_Powerups-min.gif?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ROGUELIKE:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the 'lucky blocks' to get random temporary upgrades that will help you reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll discover collectibles to unlock dashes, as well as checkpoints to save your progress at high altitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to find the different shortcuts and secret portals scattered throughout the level to cut down your time to the finish line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be patient and enjoy the journey!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760730?t=1748437062","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3760730?t=1748437062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item