h, much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/GIF_Gamemodes.gif?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different gameplay styles based on your chosen challenge:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STREAMER TWITCH</strong>:\u00a0<u>Connect your game to your Twitch channel</u>! Your chat can interact and mess with you using commands, subs, and bits! In return, you\u2019ll unlock character upgrades, and either you or your chat will have to choose between different options. How about a double jump in exchange for 5 subs?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SPEEDRUN</strong>:\u00a0Compete to reach the global top of the <u>Steam leaderboard</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Trial</strong>: Reach the next checkpoint before the timer hits 0 to reset it. There's no time for falling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode</strong>: Do you like cozy games where you can relax by baking cakes? Well, in this game, you need to sit on the cake and... try to reach the top without losing control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/extras/GIF_Powerups-min.gif?t=1748437062\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>ROGUELIKE:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the 'lucky blocks' to get random temporary upgrades that will help you reach the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll discover collectibles to unlock dashes, as well as checkpoints to save your progress at high altitudes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to find the different shortcuts and secret portals scattered throughout the level to cut down your time to the finish line!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be patient and enjoy the journey!</p>","developers":["Numantikun GameDev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3451130","name":"Ascend the Dome"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760730/b832b05e919b4b5e848b9923c61bcd37cd7ca1e9/header.jpg?t=1748437062","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142669,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142669/movie480.mp4?t=1748284221","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142669/movie_max.mp4?t=1748284221"},"name":"Trailer Ascend the Dome","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142669/089726eb0802421dcc92e5929fed4578830815aa/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748284221","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142669/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748284221","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142669/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748284221"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257146095,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146095/movie480.mp4?t=1748295026","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146095/movie_max.mp4?t=1748295026"},"name":"Speedrun highlights","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146095/4d0323a6b44055cbbbeccfcb7591cf7681e98803/movie